The original upstream project provides Telegram print notifications for
Moonraker without the Apprise library.

This OpenCreator edition is an adaptation for OpenCreator and Flashforge
Creator 5. It adds a standalone web interface, local account authentication,
English and Italian interface packs, configuration management, printer
monitoring, SOC/Tunneled mode gating, startup notifications and OpenCreator
plugin lifecycle scripts.

